    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The returned <code>ProblemDetail</code> may be\nupdated before the response is rendered, for example, via\n<a href=\"../../../ErrorResponse.html#updateAndGetBody(org.springframework.context.MessageSource,java.util.Locale)\"><code>ErrorResponse.updateAndGetBody(MessageSource, Locale)</code></a>. Therefore, implementing\nmethods should use an instance field, and should not re-create the\n<code>ProblemDetail</code> on every call, nor use a static variable.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 返回的 <code>ProblemDetail</code> 可能在响应渲染之前被更新，例如通过<a href=\"../../../ErrorResponse.html#updateAndGetBody(org.springframework.context.MessageSource,java.util.Locale)\"><code>ErrorResponse.updateAndGetBody(MessageSource, Locale)</code></a>。因此，实现方法应使用实例字段，不应在每次调用时重新创建 <code>ProblemDetail</code>，也不应使用静态变量。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default the exception will be handled as a 503 error.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，该异常将作为 503 错误进行处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the body for the response, formatted as an RFC 9457\n<a href=\"../../../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a> whose <a href=\"../../../../http/ProblemDetail.html#getStatus()\"><code>status</code></a>\nshould match the response status.",
      "translation": "返回响应正文，格式为 RFC 9457<a href=\"../../../../http/ProblemDetail.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ProblemDetail</code></a>，其<a href=\"../../../../http/ProblemDetail.html#getStatus()\"><code>status</code></a>应与响应状态匹配。",
      "count": 2
    },
